# Pure SaaS: /pure-saas accessible

Improve accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA) and inclusive interaction across markup and styles.

## Usage
Type `@pure-saas-accessible [request]` or `/pure-saas accessible [request]` in Composer or Chat.

## Instructions
1. Ensure HTML5 semantic landmarks (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`, `<dialog>`).
2. Verify all controls are operable via keyboard (`Tab`, `Enter`, `Space`, `Escape`) with visible focus rings.
3. Check color contrast: ≥ 4.5:1 for normal text, ≥ 3:1 for large text and UI boundaries.
4. Connect all form inputs to explicit `<label>` tags with `aria-describedby` for error text.
5. Provide `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` fallbacks for non-essential animations.
6. Verify minimum 44x44px touch targets.
